# Never connected to a live database in this build (1.overall-architecture.md,
# "A live Postgres, and therefore Prisma's runtime client" — deliberately not built).
# This placeholder only satisfies Prisma's schema loader for `prisma validate` and
# `prisma migrate diff`, both of which run entirely offline.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/blotato?schema=public"
